@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health check -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ -> 201 + Location, status=received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200599",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/edusubmit"
}

### 4. Đọc lại lượt nộp -> 200; gọi vài lần để quan sát received -> grading -> graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST vào bài tập không tồn tại -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200599",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/edusubmit"
}

### 7. GET id lượt nộp sai định dạng -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/not-a-guid

### 8. SignalR negotiate đúng đường dẫn -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn Hub -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
